{
    "title": "Dabble - DFS & Player Props",
    "description": "Welcome to Dabble, the ultimate destination for daily fantasy sports (DFS)!\r\n\r\nWhether you're an NFL fantasy football fanatic or love to dabble in various fantasy sports, Dabble has everything you need to turn your picks into real money winnings. \r\n\r\nWith over 1M global users and $25M in payouts, Dabble is the global leader in social DFS.\r\n\r\nGET $25 FREE ON SIGN UP \u2013 NO DEPOSIT NECESSARY\r\nStarting with Dabble is easy! New users get $25 FREE when signing up \u2013 no deposit is necessary. \r\n\r\nAlready a Dabbler? Refer a friend and get $10 for every new user you bring into Dabble.\r\n\r\nWIN UP TO 1000X YOUR MONEY\r\nDabble lets you win BIG! Whether you\u2019re picking your NFL fantasy football team or making player props in other sports, you can win up to 1000X your money by picking more or less on player props. From NFL fantasy picks to fantasy Premier League predictions, Dabble has you covered.\r\n\r\nTHE GLOBAL LEADER IN SOCIAL DFS\r\nDabble isn\u2019t just another DFS app. It\u2019s the ultimate social platform where you can connect with other fantasy sports lovers. \r\n\r\nCOPY BET: FOLLOW THE EXPERTS\r\nNot sure about your picks? No problem! With our Copy Bet feature, you can easily follow and duplicate the entries of your favorite Dabblers, including DFS experts and sports stars. This feature is perfect for those who want to tail the action without the hassle of researching every pick. Just find a Dabbler you trust and ride their picks to victory.\r\n\r\nJOIN THE BANTER TODAY\r\nAt Dabble, we believe that sports are better with friends. Our in-app chat channels let you discuss your picks, celebrate your wins, and talk smack with other DFS lovers. Join the banter and make every game more exciting with Dabble\u2019s lively community.\r\n\r\nSAFE, SECURE, AND FAST PAYOUTS\r\nAt Dabble, we prioritize your safety and satisfaction. We process thousands of payouts every day, ensuring that your winnings are always secure and promptly delivered. With $25M in payouts to date, Dabble is a trusted name in the DFS world.\r\n\r\nALL YOUR FAVORITE SPORTS \r\nDabble offers a deep list of sports for your fantasy picks:\r\nNFL Fantasy Football\r\nMLB Fantasy Baseball\r\nFantasy UFC\r\nWNBA & NBA Fantasy Basketball \r\nFantasy Premier League\r\nNHL Fantasy Hockey\r\nNCAA College Football & College Hoops\r\nFantasy Tennis (ATP Tennis / WTA Tennis)\r\nCFL Fantasy Football\r\nMLS Fantasy Soccer, UEFA Champions League & Copa America\r\nFantasy Cricket (Major League Cricket &T20 World Cup)\r\nAnd we keep adding more!\r\nNo matter what sport you love, Dabble has the perfect platform for you to test your knowledge and win real money.\r\n\r\nWHO IS DABBLE?\r\nAt Dabble, we invented the social sports betting category from Australia nearly five years ago. The Aussie market absolutely loved our combination of COPY, FOLLOW, CHAT & COMMUNITY that we brought it to the US. \r\n\r\nAnd now we have an office in Austin, Texas. And we\u2019re loving it y\u2019all. \r\n\r\nSince launching in 2023 we\u2019ve been the fastest growing daily fantasy sports app in the US!\r\n\r\nWHO CAN PLAY?\r\nUS residents only. Users must be 18 or older.\r\nDabble's real money games can be now be played in Arkansas, West Virginia and Wyoming!\r\n\r\nSo we\u2019re live in the following states:\r\nAlaska\r\nArkansas\r\nCalifornia\r\nDistrict of Columbia\r\nFlorida\r\nGeorgia\r\nIllinois\r\nIndiana\r\nKansas\r\nKentucky\r\nMinnesota\r\nNebraska\r\nNew Mexico\r\nNorth Carolina\r\nNorth Dakota\r\nOklahoma\r\nOregon\r\nRhode Island\r\nSouth Carolina\r\nSouth Dakota\r\nTexas\r\nUtah\r\nWest Virginia\r\nWisconsin\r\nWyoming\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBLE GAMING\r\nDabble is committed to responsible gaming and protecting our players is a top priority. For gambling addiction support, please contact the National Problem Gambling Helpline at 1-800-522-4700 or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/\r\n\r\nJOIN DABBLE TODAY\r\nReady to turn your picks into real money? Download Dabble today and start playing the most exciting DFS app on the market. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re into NFL fantasy football, NBA fantasy, or any other sport, Dabble has what you need. Download the app NOW and join in the banter.",
